01:09:15.673 --> 01:09:17.758
Dumaan ka ba sa mga dokumento dito?

01:09:18.592 --> 01:09:20.344
I swear I had these arrange neatly.

01:09:20.427 --> 01:09:21.637
nakuha ko na.

01:09:21.720 --> 01:09:24.556
Nalaman ko kung bakit
may kakulangan sa supply ang Blaze Eagles.

01:09:24.640 --> 01:09:25.808
Hyun-jun!

01:09:26.642 --> 01:09:27.601
Kahit mamatay ako,

01:09:28.143 --> 01:09:29.561
Ang Typhoon Trading ay hindi bababa.

01:09:33.274 --> 01:09:35.276
Pagsasalin ng subtitle ni: Eunsook Youn

